() '
/F2 10 Tf
(1. PURPOSE) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(The Parties wish to explore potential business collaboration and investment) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(opportunities in digital payment infrastructure \("Purpose"\). In connection with this) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Purpose, each Party may disclose proprietary commercial and technical information.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(2. DEFINITION OF CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
("Confidential Information" means all non-public information disclosed directly or) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(indirectly by Disclosing Party to Receiving Party, whether orally, visually, or in) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(writing, including but not limited to business plans, financial models, customer) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(data, source code, patent applications, algorithmic architectures, and trade secrets.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(3. EXCLUSIONS FROM CONFIDENTIALITY) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Confidential Information does not include information that:) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(\(a\) is or becomes generally available to the public without breach of this Agreement;) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(\(b\) was already rightfully in Receiving Party's possession prior to disclosure) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(without confidentiality restrictions;) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(\(c\) is lawfully received from a third party without breach of any confidentiality) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(obligation; or) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(\(d\) is independently developed by Receiving Party without access to or reliance upon) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Disclosing Party's Confidential Information.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(4. OBLIGATIONS OF RECEIVING PARTY) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(4.1 Standard of Care. Receiving Party shall protect Disclosing Party's Confidential) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(Information with the same degree of care it uses for its own confidential information) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(of like nature, but in no event less than reasonable care.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(4.2 Permitted Disclosures. Receiving Party may disclose Confidential Information only) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(to its employees, directors, legal counsel, and financial advisors who need to know) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(for the Purpose and who are bound by confidentiality obligations at least as) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(restrictive as this Agreement.) '
/F2 9.5 Tf
(4.3 Non-Use. Receiving Party shall not use Confidential Information for any purpose) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(other than evaluating and pursuing the Purpose.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
(5. COMPELLED DISCLOSURE) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(If Receiving Party is requested or required by law, court subpoena, or governmental) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(authority to disclose any Confidential Information, Receiving Party shall provide) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(prompt written notice to Disclosing Party to enable Disclosing Party to seek a) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
(protective order or contest the disclosure.) '
/F1 8.5 Tf
() '
/F2 10 Tf
